CARI4D FoundationPose export: also write every registration call's full candidate pool beside the pickle.
Applies on top of cari4d-fp-no-observation-nan.patch (input md5 556a32239f14f8b87a137f1edec26514); output md5 b54ca7dd78a90b9d61e1193e006bdc7f.
Why: the per-frame pick follows the previously confirmed pose, so a branch picked wrongly is followed for whole segments,
and CoCoNet (stage 06) follows that initialization (Tier 3 handoff, 10-16/10-17). Choosing over the whole timeline needs
the ~200 ranked candidates of every call, which the exporter computes and drops. The selection and the pickle are
untouched (A/B 10-19 on ep03 frames 440-460: pickle identical to the unpatched run, which is itself reproducible).
Output: <out>.candidates.npz, revision maniphys-tier3-fp-candidates-v1, written before the pickle.
